     "lineid": null,
     "text_raw": "Cut the 17 degree angle on the piece by marking the two vertical distances and snapping a guide chalk line to connect the two. Use a 7-1/4\"circular saw to make the cut.",
     "text_rendered": "Cut the 17 degree angle on the piece by marking the two vertical distances and snapping a guide chalk line to connect the two. Use a 7-1/4&quot;circular saw to make the cut."
    },
    {
